MLIR-AIE / TileFuse adaptations

The graph topology follows AMD's MLIR-AIE whole_array matmul example at
7e00b57955e108fe9d8e9419f5828a0c7e650858.

The BFP16 W4A16 projection strategy adapts aie_kernels/aie2p/mix_int4_ATB.cc
and programming_examples/tilefuse/gemm_w4a16/makefile-common from
https://github.com/glassescrab/mlir-aie at
121dd54abc68f84d89a7074372ebf82be2db62d5.

