Local adaptations retain HeteroMega's compact W4A16 tensor layout, explicit
invocation state, per-column dequantization, FP32 partial sums between K groups,
eight-column FFN graph and fused SiLU/multiply. The optimized zero-point
metadata uses exact BF16 bit construction for unsigned four-bit zeros.
